// Dapple's calibrated Norway spruce bark: thin, overlapping, curled scales,
// reddish brown to grey. Each tree bakes it at these heights on its trunk,
// at its own girth there, and renderers blend the stages up the stem; the
// girth and height below give the species' own set for card bakes.
(module: "spruce", girth: 1.5, height: 1.3, size: 1024, stages: [0.3, 1.3, 4.0, 10.0])
